{"type":"data","nodes":[null,{"type":"data","data":[{"title":1,"excerpt":2,"tags":3,"film":6},"La liberté si je veux !","Atteinte d’une maladie incurable, Babeth n’aura qu’un regret : ne jamais avoir vu New-York et sa statue de la liberté. Sans un sou en poche, Claire et Maud décident de l’aider à réaliser son rêve. A partir de la banlieue de Caen, c’est en voiture que nos complices partent à la conquête du nouveau monde. A travers les paysages normands, leur périple les mènera, de rêves en détours et contre toute attente, à destination.",[4,5],"physical illness","bucket list",{"type":7,"id":8,"slug":9,"title":10,"release":12,"filmType":16,"directors":17,"genre":29,"media":32,"synopsis":35,"production":36,"characters":39,"roles":40,"awards":48,"tags":3},"Film","FR2018_204","fr2018-204-la-liberte-si-je-veux",{"native":1,"english":11},"",{"type":13,"date":14,"year":15},"Theatrical release",null,0,"Fiction film",[18,25],{"id":19,"slug":20,"name":19,"birthYear":21,"deathYear":15,"gender":22,"nationality":23,"awards":24},"Laurent Brard","laurent-brard",1971,"Male identifying","France",[],{"id":26,"slug":27,"name":26,"birthYear":15,"deathYear":15,"gender":22,"nationality":23,"awards":28},"Marc Rapilly","marc-rapilly",[],[30,31],"Comedy","Drama",{"posterUrl":33,"trailerUrl":34},"https://www.acsea.asso.fr/wp-content/uploads/2018/03/Libert%C3%A9sijeveux-683x1024.jpg","https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=SZtpAq5Bxqk",{"native":2,"english":11},[37],{"country":23,"share":38},"Majority coproducer",[],[41,45],{"person":42,"role":44},{"id":19,"slug":20,"name":19,"birthYear":21,"deathYear":15,"gender":22,"nationality":23,"awards":43},[],"Director of the film",{"person":46,"role":44},{"id":26,"slug":27,"name":26,"birthYear":15,"deathYear":15,"gender":22,"nationality":23,"awards":47},[],[]],"uses":{"params":["slug"]}}]}
